* text=auto

# 源码一律 LF：这些文件在 Windows 上编辑，统一行尾可避免整文件 diff 噪声
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 运行时资产显式声明 binary。仓库现在跟踪 VRM / VRMA / ASR 引擎等大二进制，
# 不声明的话 `* text=auto` 会对它们做行尾探测，一旦某次提交被判定成文本，
# 整个文件会被改写、体积膨胀且模型直接损坏。Git 默认不做 delta 压缩，也可省一层无用功。
*.vrm  binary
*.vrma binary
*.glb  binary
*.fbx  binary
*.wasm binary
*.onnx binary
*.data binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
